  <h2 id="4-feature-matrix-product-mechanics">4. Feature Matrix &amp; Product Mechanics</h2>

  <h3>1. Zero Bias, Pure Consensus</h3>
  <p><strong>Headline:</strong> Real opinions, unconditioned by algorithms.</p>
  <p><strong>Body:</strong> To see how the world thinks, you must answer first. No pre-conditioned opinions, algorithmic feeds, or echo chambers—only honest, raw perspectives.</p>

  <h3>2. Demographic Pulse &amp; Cross-Sectional Filters</h3>
  <p><strong>Headline:</strong> Understand not just what people think, but who thinks it.</p>
  <p><strong>Body:</strong> Filter real human sentiment across age brackets (18–24, 25–34, 35–44, 45–54, 55+), genders, and geographic regions. Discover generational consensus and cultural contrasts.</p>

  <h3>3. Radical Privacy &amp; Cryptographic Safety</h3>
  <p><strong>Headline:</strong> Your answers are private; humanity's knowledge is permanent.</p>
  <p><strong>Body:</strong> Built on privacy-first architecture with end-to-end encryption in transit (TLS). We store aggregate statistics, not personal dossiers.</p>

  <h3>4. Reciprocal Participation Engine</h3>
  <p><strong>Headline:</strong> Earn credits through participation; spend credits to ask and boost.</p>
  <p><strong>Body:</strong> Answering questions yields credits. Credits unlock question publishing, priority demographic boosting, and community reputation. A self-sustaining economy of human curiosity.</p>

  <h3>5. The Consensus Graph (Neo4j)</h3>
  <p><strong>Headline:</strong> A living, interconnected knowledge map of human thought.</p>
  <p><strong>Body:</strong> Queries like <code>MATCH (q:Question)-[:CONSENSUS]-&gt;(d:Demographics) RETURN q.title, d.ageGroup, d.breakdown</code> enable deep sociological queries and collective intelligence modeling.</p>

  <h3>6. Intelligent Dilemma Deduplication</h3>
  <p><strong>Headline:</strong> Consolidated knowledge, not fragmented votes.</p>
  <p><strong>Body:</strong> Identical questions are merged into a single node to maximize sample size and analytical depth.</p>

  <hr />

